			"Message": "style(Output): Consolidate README table cells and inline emoji markers\n\nThe README table previously used separate table cells for emoji indicators (⚫ status dot and 🏞️ Land emoji), creating unnecessary column fragmentation. Merge each emoji into its adjacent header cell — the status dot with \"Output\" and the landscape emoji with the \"Land\" link — reducing the table from four columns to two.\n\nThis simplifies the markup while preserving the visual hierarchy and semantic meaning of each badge.",
